# Testing & Quality Guardrails

1. Run `npm test` before committing any change under `server/`.
2. Run `npm run build:web` before committing any change under `web/`.
3. For changes to `server/heuristics/evaluate.js`:
   - Verify JS syntax: `node --check server/heuristics/evaluate.js`.
   - Ensure the closure is 100% self-contained (no imports or outer scope dependencies).
4. Run e2e smoke verification whenever engine, crawler, or diff code is modified.
